    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 100px;">
        <h2 class="section-title">Part of a series on electrification and safety in Food & Beverage processing</h2>
        <h1 class="section-title" style="margin-top: 10px;">ABB Food & Beverage Safety Series</h1>
        <h2 class="section-title" style="font-size: 24px;">Considerations for boosting productivity and preserving safety across the food & beverage production cycle</h2>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
        <div class="body-text">
            Over decades in the Food & Beverage industry, we've found many food recalls and <span class="highlight">outages are preventable</span>. Whether prompted by a recall or threat, identified through a site assessment, or integrated into proactive planning, there are <span class="highlight">six key areas</span> we consistently find food and beverage partners need to assess or address.
        </div>
