</div>

<div class="page">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
        <div style="font-size: 14px;">3</div>
        <div style="font-size: 14px;">CONSIDERATIONS FOR BOOSTING PRODUCTIVITY AND PRESERVING SAFETY</div>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
        <div class="body-text">
            The United Nations predicts food production must increase by <span data-field="percentage_increase">{{ percentage_increase }}</span> between 2010 and 2050 to meet growing population needs.<sup style="font-size: 10px;">1</sup>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 30px;">
            <div style="font-size: 120px; line-height: 1;">70%</div>
            <div style="font-size: 18px; margin-top: -10px;">to meet the needs of our growing global population. We all need to eat to survive.</div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top: 60px;">
        <div class="process-flow">
            <div class="process-step">
                <div style="font-size: 24px;">&#127020;</div>
                <div class="process-step-title">Farming equipment & additives</div>
